<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμόργ-νῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wipe,</i>
			aor.
			
				Act.
			 opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμόρξαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					558
				</span></i>
			 ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμαρξον</span>: —
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυά τ᾽ ὠμόργνυντο</span>
			<i>were drying their</i> tears, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.527
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				530
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶ παρειάων δάκρυ᾽ ὀμορξαμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.124
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾶκον ὀμόργνυσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pythag.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.17
			</span></i>. (The simple Verb is 
				Ep.
			, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ-, ἐξομόργνυμι</span>
			are used also in 
				Att.
			) (Cf. Skt. <i>mrjáti</i> 'wipe'.)</div>
